          "content": "# Monitor competitor websites & RSS feeds for changes → GPT summary → Slack alert\n\nRuns daily, detects new RSS items and page-content changes with the **glueworks/rss-change-monitor** Apify Actor, summarizes each change with GPT, and posts a Slack alert.\n\n**Setup:** add Apify, OpenAI and Slack credentials, edit the `sources` list in the Apify node, pick a Slack channel. That's it."
